homelab-mailread (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release. Dovecot IMAP/LMTP/ManageSieve provisioning: SQL
    passdb/userdb against dovecot.users, homelab-api OAuth2 introspection
    passdb, Maildir storage + quota, Sieve, drop-in-only config (never
    edits vendor Dovecot files), doveconf -n pre-check that refuses to
    auto-activate over existing hand-configured auth, Dovecot 2.3.x
    version guard.

